Formatter: an expression statement that is a binary/bool/compare expression with comments
must be parenthesized, or removed inner parentheses leave it unbreakable and unstable.
Regression test included; fuzz repro: repro/fix-formatter-binary-statement-comments.py (ruff_formatter_idempotency).

